@startuml Admin Login MFA Sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam shadowing false

title Admin Login Flow — Two-Step Authentication with Mandatory TOTP MFA

actor "Admin User" as admin
participant "Admin SPA\n(Angular 20)" as spa
participant "api-admin\n(Quarkus :8081)" as api
database "PostgreSQL" as db
participant "TOTP\n(Google Auth)" as totp

== Step 1: Password Login ==

admin -> spa : Enter email + password
spa -> api : POST /api/admin/v1/auth/login\n{email, password}
api -> db : SELECT admin_user\nWHERE email = ?
api -> api : Verify BCrypt hash\n(cost 12)
api -> api : Check mfa_secret\nIS NULL?

alt MFA not yet enrolled (first login)
    api -> api : Generate TOTP secret\n(SecureRandom, 20 bytes)
    api -> db : UPDATE admin_user\nSET mfa_secret = ?
    api -> api : Build otpauth:// URI
    api --> spa : 200 {state: MFA_ENROLLMENT_REQUIRED,\nchallenge_jwt, qr_provisioning_uri}
    spa --> admin : Display QR code\n"Scan with Google Authenticator"
else MFA already enrolled
    api --> spa : 200 {state: MFA_REQUIRED,\nchallenge_jwt}
    spa --> admin : "Enter 6-digit TOTP code"
end

== Step 2: TOTP Verification ==

admin -> totp : Open authenticator app\n(generate 6-digit code)
admin -> spa : Enter TOTP code
spa -> api : POST /api/admin/v1/auth/verify-mfa\n{challenge_jwt, totp_code}
api -> api : Verify challenge JWT\n(purpose = mfa-challenge,\nTTL = 5 minutes)
api -> api : Verify TOTP code\n(RFC 6238, HMAC-SHA1,\nconstant-time compare)
api -> db : UPDATE admin_user\nSET mfa_enrolled_at = now(),\nlast_login_at = now()
api -> api : Issue access JWT (15min TTL)\n+ refresh token (30day TTL)
api -> db : INSERT admin_refresh_token\n(SHA-256 hashed, IP, User-Agent)
api --> spa : 200 {access_token, refresh_token,\nexpires_at, admin_profile}
spa --> admin : Redirect to /dashboard

== Subsequent Authenticated Requests ==

admin -> spa : Navigate to admin page
spa -> api : GET /api/admin/v1/...\nAuthorization: Bearer <access_jwt>
api -> api : JwtAuthFilter verifies\nsignature + issuer + audience + exp
api -> api : SecurityContextHolder\npopulated with roles
api -> api : requireAdmin() +\nrequireAnyRole("SUPERADMIN", ...)
api --> spa : 200 {data}

@enduml
